  "-1596448684": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1244344430,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You freed her. You released that monster back into the world!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-492955574": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1244344430,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I told you to be careful. I warned you, and yet… you fell for her tricks. Do you have any idea what you’ve unleashed?!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1737003153": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1244344430,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Nyxara destroyed my home once before. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1232120026": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1244344430,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I tracked her here to keep others safe… but now, because of you, she’s loose again. I won’t let her wreak havoc on this city.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "626533148": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1244344430,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "I can’t stay here. I’m going after her, and I’ll destroy her myself… even if it kills me. You’re on your own now. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1110932712": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1244344430,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Consider this my final lesson: never trust a spirit’s word. Not even once.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1210947048": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 58281359,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "When I first encountered Nyxara… she looked the same—weak, innocent, pleading for mercy.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-133073855": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 58281359,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "And like a fool, I believed her. I thought I could help her. That maybe, she was different from the other spirits.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1577225589": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 58281359,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I let her into my village, welcomed her… shared my bed with her. And because of my stupidity, she turned on us. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-617916454": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": 58281359,
   "children": [
    1268916009,
    1249253209,
    -1554324129
   ],
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "She unleashed horrors upon my people, and I was powerless to stop it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "29849771": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 58281359,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "My wife… my son… they died because of me. I gave that monster a home. Invited evil into our lives.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1605608758": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 58281359,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "The main threat is over now. Because you denied her entrance to the real world, she’ll remain trapped in the spirit realm… for at least a thousand years.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "374466922": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 58281359,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "You’ve done what I couldn’t—saved this place without losing yourself.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "709353726": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 58281359,
   "actor": "Master Zhen",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "The spirits will still linger, and you can continue hunting them if you wish, but their power will be nothing compared to Nyxara’s. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
